{"id":"2734542658fc03f4fdafde2f80193adf72373819","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231932","title":"求教大佬！公司降薪后打算跳槽","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"k960128","excerpt":"技术栈 - @k960128 - 目前在职公司已经降薪，准备寻找新机会。听说不少企业背调会要求提供薪资流水，一旦拿出流水，HR 很容易直接以我当前降薪后的薪资作为基准来定薪资涨幅。想问问大家遇到这种情况，有什么沟通技巧？如何向 H","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/k960128\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cb22dc2dc441724c6d945296e626f207?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"k960128\" data-uid=\"574509\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    <h2>求教大佬！公司降薪后打算跳槽</h2>\n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/k960128\">k960128</a> · <span title=\"2026-08-04 10:39:30 +08:00\">21h 58m ago</span> · 1086 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>目前在职公司已经降薪，准备寻找新机会。听说不少企业背调会要求提供薪资流水，一旦拿出流水，HR 很容易直接以我当前降薪后的薪资作为基准来定薪资涨幅。\n想问问大家遇到这种情况，有什么沟通技巧？如何向 HR 说明情况，争取匹配自身市场价值，不被现有缩水薪资限制？</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/跳槽\"><li></li> 跳槽</a><a href=\"/tag/薪资\"><li></li> 薪资</a><a href=\"/tag/谈判\"><li></li> 谈判</a></P><p><span>8 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-04 14:46:03 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17934985\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ba37/f61b/672399_normal.png?m=1751448827\" alt=\"peteretep\" data-uid=\"672399\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/peteretep\">peteretep</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 10:41:01 +08:00\">21h 56m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>流水至少是看半年的啊， 如果降了没多长时间，那么应该会按照之前的算的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935145\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b26523b3dcc3dfb9d27d081fd28ac34?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"niboy\" data-uid=\"71363\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/niboy\">niboy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 10:59:17 +08:00\">21h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>劳动合同里有提薪水也行，我之前都欠薪很久，没啥流水。<br>不过还是被降薪 20%了，能力是能力，HR 想压低薪资</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935157\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9146b471d6c7f2d6cdc5b29c351a31e7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fish2050\" data-uid=\"420586\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fish2050\">fish2050</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:00:46 +08:00\">21h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司降薪，前同事跳槽去其他公司了，我们很少加班，他过去经常加班</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935503\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f770921f374e6c0950842c15d3810ece?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xz410236056\" data-uid=\"156057\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xz410236056\">xz410236056</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:41:53 +08:00\">20h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你那流水扯点别的不就有了？餐补打餐卡里。每个月个税抵扣巴拉巴拉，HR 又不会仔细算</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7a6b/422d/768688_normal.png?m=1769242816\" alt=\"liubai256\" data-uid=\"768688\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liubai256\">liubai256</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:46:42 +08:00\">20h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>hr 说什么理由不都是为了压你工资，这个解释清楚了也会有别的理由压，没啥意义，多找找只能</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17936416\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_normal.png?m=1778467100\" alt=\"rrubick\" data-uid=\"102175\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rrubick\">rrubick</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 14:46:03 +08:00\">17h 51m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就说降薪后就开始面试了，薪资还按之前的谈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"求教大佬！公司降薪后打算跳槽 k960128 · 21h 58m ago · 1086 views 目前在职公司已经降薪，准备寻找新机会。听说不少企业背调会要求提供薪资流水，一旦拿出流水，HR 很容易直接以我当前降薪后的薪资作为基准来定薪资涨幅。 想问问大家遇到这种情况，有什么沟通技巧？如何向 HR 说明情况，争取匹配自身市场价值，不被现有缩水薪资限制？ 跳槽 薪资 谈判8 replies • 2026-08-04 14:46:03 +08:00 1 peteretep 21h 56m ago 1 流水至少是看半年的啊， 如果降了没多长时间，那么应该会按照之前的算的 4 niboy 21h 38m a